Use these payment settings for Android and iOS:
1. Use Business UPI ID Only
Use a verified business UPI like:
yourstore@paytm 
Do NOT use:
personal UPI IDs
temporary QR UPI IDs
invalid VPA format
Use only verified merchant/business UPI.
2. Correct UPI Payment URL Format
Generate payment links like this:
upi://pay?pa=yourstore@paytm&pn=Big%20Dhamaka%20Sale&am=499&cu=INR&tn=Order%201245 
Parameters:
ParameterMeaningpaPayee UPI IDpnStore/merchant nameamAmountcuCurrencytnTransaction note
3. Important Security Settings
Always Use HTTPS
Your website MUST use SSL:
https://yourdomain.com 
Never use:
http://
localhost in production
IP address URLs
Otherwise Android/iPhone may show:
security warning
unsafe payment
blocked intent
4. Open UPI Apps Using Intent Method
For Android:
window.location.href = upiLink; 
For iOS Safari:
window.open(upiLink, "_self"); 
Do NOT use:
iframe
popup blockers
embedded webview payment
hidden redirects
5. Add Allowed UPI Apps
Show buttons like:
Paytm
Google Pay
PhonePe
BHIM
Example:
const upiLink = upi://pay?pa=yourstore@paytm&pn=Big Dhamaka Sale&am=499&cu=INR; window.location.href = upiLink; 
6. Encode Merchant Name Properly
Wrong:
pn=Big Dhamaka Sale 
Correct:
pn=Big%20Dhamaka%20Sale 
Improper encoding causes payment parsing errors.
7. Do NOT Use WebView Payment
Inside Android/iOS apps:
Avoid:
WebView payment opening
iframe payment
embedded browser payment
Use:
external app redirect
deep linking
8. Recommended Mobile Flow
Android
User clicks “Pay with UPI”
Detect installed UPI apps
Open selected app
User pays
Redirect back to success page
iPhone (iOS)
Use direct intent launch:
window.location.href = upiLink; 
Do not use:
custom popup
async redirect delay
Safari blocks unsafe redirects.
9. Add Merchant Information Clearly
Show on checkout page:
Merchant Name
Business UPI ID
Order Amount
Secure HTTPS icon
This reduces fraud/security warnings.
10. Avoid These Mistakes
These cause security errors:
❌ Invalid UPI format
❌ HTTP website
❌ WebView payment
❌ Auto redirect without user click
❌ Wrong URL encoding
❌ Fake merchant name mismatch
❌ Using personal UPI in commercial store
11. Recommended Production Setup
SettingRecommendedSSLCloudflare or Let's EncryptDomainCustom domainPayment MethodUPI IntentMerchantPaytm BusinessRedirectDirect app launchMobile SupportAndroid + iOSServerNode.jsDatabaseSupabase
12. Example Final Working UPI Link
upi://pay?pa=yourstore@paytm&pn=Big%20Dhamaka%20Sale&am=999&cu=INR&tn=Order%20ID%201245 
This format works properly with:
Paytm
PhonePe
Google Pay
BHIM
Amazon Pay UPI
when opened from HTTPS website.